  "sourceText": "Green Chili Cheese Pie\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:27am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 eggs\n1/2 cup milk\n1 small can chopped green chilies drained\n1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese\n1 cup Monterey Jack cheese shredded\n1/4 teaspoon red pepper sauce\n9 inch pie crust\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix well and pour into 9 inch pie crust. Bake at 350 degrees for 45 minutes.",
